{% doc %}
  Report a problem — the small line marks.

  Used twice by `sv-report`: on the triage cards, where each one draws
  itself as its card arrives, and on the route cards, where they sit
  still. Both cases are covered by drawing on a 48-unit box with no
  fills and no stroke declared here — the section's stylesheet owns the
  stroke, so one rule sets the colour, the weight and the draw for every
  mark at once.

  Line art rather than glyphs because these are drawn: an icon font
  cannot animate its own stroke, and a filled pictogram has nothing to
  draw. Paths are kept to a handful of segments each so the dash length
  the section assumes (260 units) comfortably covers the longest of
  them.

  @param {string} art - which mark. Unknown values fall through to a
    neutral circle, so a new claim type added in the editor before its
    drawing exists renders a mark rather than an empty box.
{% enddoc %}

{%- case art -%}

  {%- when 'damaged' -%}
    {%- comment -%} A garment with the seam open — the tear is the subject. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M17 7 L11 11 L9 20 L14 21 L14 41 L34 41 L34 21 L39 20 L37 11 L31 7"/>
      <path d="M17 7 C 19 11, 29 11, 31 7"/>
      <path class="sv-rp-gold" d="M24 21 L21 26 L26 29 L22 34 L25 38"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'wrong' -%}
    {%- comment -%} Two tags, swapped — one arriving, one leaving. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M8 19 L19 8 L30 8 L30 19 L19 30 Z"/>
      <circle cx="24" cy="14" r="2.2"/>
      <path class="sv-rp-gold" d="M20 40 L31 29 L40 29 L40 38 L29 49"/>
      <path d="M36 10 L41 15 L36 20"/>
      <path d="M12 38 L7 33 L12 28"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'missing' -%}
    {%- comment -%} An open box with nothing in it. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M9 18 L24 12 L39 18 L39 36 L24 42 L9 36 Z"/>
      <path d="M9 18 L24 24 L39 18"/>
      <path d="M24 24 L24 42"/>
      <path class="sv-rp-gold" d="M19 30 L29 30"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'tampered' -%}
    {%- comment -%} A parcel whose seal has been broken. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M10 14 L38 14 L38 38 L10 38 Z"/>
      <path d="M10 22 L38 22"/>
      <path class="sv-rp-gold" d="M20 10 L18 22 L24 18 L30 22 L28 10"/>
      <path class="sv-rp-gold" d="M17 30 L23 30 M27 30 L33 30"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'late' -%}
    {%- comment -%} A van that has not moved, over a stalled clock. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M6 16 L28 16 L28 32 L6 32 Z"/>
      <path d="M28 21 L36 21 L42 27 L42 32 L28 32"/>
      <circle cx="14" cy="34" r="3.4"/>
      <circle cx="35" cy="34" r="3.4"/>
      <path class="sv-rp-gold" d="M17 24 L17 20 L21 20"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'whatsapp' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      The route marks. Drawn in the same line weight as the claim marks
      rather than each platform's filled logo — the footer's float wears
      the real livery, and one page should not carry two treatments of
      the same mark.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M9 39 L11.5 31.5 A16 16 0 1 1 17.5 37 Z"/>
      <path d="M18 19 C 18 25, 23 30, 29 30 L31 27 L27 25 L25 27 C 23 26, 22 25, 21 23 L23 21 L21 17 Z"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'email' -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M7 13 L41 13 L41 35 L7 35 Z"/>
      <path d="M7 13 L24 26 L41 13"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'link' -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M21 27 A7 7 0 0 1 21 17 L27 11 A7 7 0 0 1 37 21 L34 24"/>
      <path d="M27 21 A7 7 0 0 1 27 31 L21 37 A7 7 0 0 1 11 27 L14 24"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'note' -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M13 8 L29 8 L37 16 L37 40 L13 40 Z"/>
      <path d="M29 8 L29 16 L37 16"/>
      <path d="M19 24 L31 24 M19 31 L28 31"/>
    </svg>

  {%- else -%}
    {%- comment -%} The fallback: a mark, never an empty box. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
      <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="15"/>
      <path class="sv-rp-gold" d="M24 16 L24 26"/>
      <path class="sv-rp-gold" d="M24 31 L24 32"/>
    </svg>

{%- endcase -%}
